  "number": 40,
  "meaning": "Trial and Preparation",
  "description": "The number forty symbolizes a period of trial, testing, and preparation. The flood lasted for forty days. Israel wandered in the wilderness for forty years. Moses was on Mount Sinai for forty days. Elijah traveled for forty days to Horeb. Jesus fasted for forty days in the wilderness before beginning his ministry. Between the resurrection and the ascension, forty days passed.",
